---
interface Props {
  /** 提示词全文（纯文本/markdown），点按钮整段复制 */
  prompt: string;
  /** 标签文案 */
  label?: string;
}

const { prompt, label = '完整集成提示词 · 中文版' } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="not-prose mt-6">
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div
      class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 px-4 py-2.5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900"
    >
      <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{label}</span>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-copy-btn
        class="shrink-0 rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-blue-500"
      >
        复制全文
      </button>
    </div>
    <pre
      class="max-h-[420px] overflow-auto bg-slate-950 p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200"
      tabindex="0"><code data-copy-text>{prompt}</code></pre>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">
    「组件完整源码」一段是占位符：投喂 AI 前把真实源码粘进去即可（本页不贴大段源码）。
  </p>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy-btn]').forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const box = btn.closest('section');
      const text = box?.querySelector('[data-copy-text]')?.textContent ?? '';
      const original = btn.textContent;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        btn.textContent = '已复制 ✓';
      } catch {
        btn.textContent = '复制失败，请手动选择';
      }
      setTimeout(() => {
        btn.textContent = original;
      }, 2000);
    });
  });
</script>
